@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
title Fabric Complexity Hotspots

component "FabricHandshakeRecorder\n(detm_app runtime subscriber)" as Recorder
component "runtime_composer" as Composer
component "handshake service" as Handshake
component "ack ingress" as AckIngress
component "quorum runtime" as Quorum
component "delivery runtime" as Delivery
component "epoch coordinator" as Epoch
component "transport adapter" as Transport
component "validator registry" as Registry
component "report writer" as Report

Recorder --> Composer
Composer --> Handshake
Composer --> AckIngress
Composer --> Quorum
Composer --> Delivery
Composer --> Epoch
Composer --> Transport
Composer --> Registry
Composer --> Report

note bottom of Handshake
Hotspot 1: policy matrix
(ack rules, retries, required validators)
end note

note bottom of Delivery
Hotspot 2: guarantees + tracking
(at-least-once, receipts, outbox)
end note

note bottom of Epoch
Hotspot 3: consensus/watermark
(ordering and safety boundaries)
end note

note bottom of Transport
Hotspot 4: auth/tls/backpressure/dedup
operational complexity
end note

@enduml
